WEBVTT

00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:04.985
Or one time I was checking a camera trap and I was down on my knees just arranging this camera trap.

00:00:05.065 --> 00:00:10.025
And I heard loud footprints, footsteps.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.200
And I turned around with my finger up to to tell whoever it was.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.480
I thought maybe it was one of my friend.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.200
She'd be like, yeah, walk quieter in the jungle.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.160
I'm out here being quiet.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:18.640
You could be...

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.200
The jag just walked by.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:22.960
Looked at me.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.945
Kept walking. Never even broke stride.

00:00:25.945 --> 00:00:26.905
It was just like, hey.

00:00:27.545 --> 00:00:29.625
Tongue out, big teeth out.

00:00:29.945 --> 00:00:32.105
And I was like, as close to him as I am to you.

00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:33.145
He walked right

00:00:33.145 --> 00:00:34.985
by me. Didn't care.

00:00:34.985 --> 00:00:36.265
Didn't care at all.

